{"title":"2017 USAMO Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the minimum possible value of \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/3/9530f2f6673410cf7229b9d8416c0a5c296467ae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a}{b^3+4}+\\frac{b}{c^3+4}+\\frac{c}{d^3+4}+\\frac{d}{a^3+4},\\]\" width=\"274\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/2/2c2fd75c1449ab6889f3b5c47f491da9ff07074f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c,d,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"16\" /> are nonnegative real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/b/4abe7bf20216ec9e3321ea7820466944d15ad666.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c+d=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"134\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_USAMO_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>See here: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c5t211539f5h1434574_looks_like_mount_inequality_erupted_\">https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c5t211539f5h1434574_looks_like_mount_inequality_erupted_</a>\n</p><p>or:\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LSYP_KMbBNc\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LSYP_KMbBNc</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time